//RS //! Integration tests for M12.1 — package manager (path deps, lock, store).
//RS //!
//RS //! Tests that need real file I/O create temp dirs under `std::env::temp_dir()`
//RS //! and clean up on exit. Tests that need the `jet` binary or `git` subprocess
//RS //! are skipped (not failed) if the tool is unavailable.
//RS //!
//RS //! Exit criteria (M12.1):
//RS //!   path dep, git dep (local bare), lock verify, --locked CI mode,
//RS //!   version conflict E1201, tamper E1204, two projects sharing one store inode,
//RS //!   @latest update rewrites lock, reserved section E1209, toolchain mismatch E1208,
//RS //!   end-to-end jet new → jet add --path, jet new --annotated snapshot.
//RS 
